      "what_happened": "美国 CNBC 从招聘信息发现，亚马逊组建了一支新团队，开发一款前所未有的机器人产品，可适应不断变化的家庭环境并在人类家庭成员身边自主活动；亚马逊还聘请了一名麻省理工学院的机器人专家。",
      "what_happened_en": "CNBC found from job postings that Amazon formed a new team to develop an unprecedented robot product that can adapt to changing home environments and move autonomously near family members; Amazon also hired an MIT robotics expert.",
      "why_it_matters": "亚马逊此前的 Astro 售价 1,450 美元，仅受邀购买，最终仅交付数千名客户；新团队显示亚马逊仍在押注家用机器人。",
      "why_it_matters_en": "Amazon's earlier Astro, priced at $1,450, was invite-only and reached only thousands of customers, so the new team shows Amazon is still betting on home robotics.",
