      "original_language": "zh",
      "what_happened": "马斯克在 X 上表示，特斯拉将进一步提高 Cybercab 能效，用上 40kWh 电池组，并推出液态银色；特斯拉将取消得州超级工厂的 Cybertruck 生产线，把产能腾出来生产更多 Cybercab，目前在奥斯汀投入 Robotaxi 运营的 Cybercab 配备 48kWh 电池组。",
      "what_happened_en": "Musk said on X that Tesla will further improve Cybercab efficiency with a 40kWh battery pack and add a Liquid Silver color; Tesla will cancel the Cybertruck line at Giga Texas to free capacity for more Cybercab production, while Austin Robotaxi Cybercab currently uses a 48kWh pack.",
